# GitHub handles approved to bypass the contribution gate.
#
# Format: <github-username> <capability>
#   issue  future issues from this user stay open
#   pr     future issues and PRs from this user stay open
#
# One entry per line, exactly two whitespace-separated tokens. Blank lines
# and lines starting with `#` are ignored. Entries are added by maintainers
# after a maintainer reply of `lgtmi` (issue) or `lgtm` (pr) in the command
# position described in CONTRIBUTING.md. Collaborators with write access are
# skipped automatically by the gate and do not need an entry.
